{"seq":2,"slug":"minority-interest-nci","title":"少数股东权益（NCI）与合并价差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-entity-financial-close-consolidation/consolidation-worksheet/minority-interest-nci","wordCount":2736,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"少数股东权益-nci-与合并价差\">少数股东权益（NCI）与合并价差</h1><p>集团的合并报表里有一块数字不属于母公司股东：子公司的净资产与当期利润中，由外部股东持有的那部分。它叫少数股东权益（non-controlling interests，NCI）。这块数字有两个特殊之处：一是在合并资产负债表上它必须列在<strong>权益内部</strong>、与母公司权益分开（IFRS 10 第 22 段要求它在合并财务状况表中「在权益之内、与母公司所有者权益分开列示」，within equity, separately from the equity of the owners of the parent，条文见 <a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/content/dam/ifrs/publications/html-standards/english/2023/issued/ifrs10.html\">IFRS 10 标准全文</a>）；二是它的计量方式不止一种，而不同的选择会改变商誉的金额。</p>\n<p>这一篇讲 NCI 的计算口径、合并价差（商誉与廉价购买利得）的形成与后续计量，以及这两个科目在底稿上如何分列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>NCI 的本质是「合并主体的净资产中，不属于母公司股东的那一份」。它的计算看似简单——净资产乘以少数股权比例——但在实务中有三个变量会改变结果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变量</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>决定时点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>持股比例（直接 / 间接 / 有效比例）</td>\n<td>决定 NCI 份额</td>\n<td>主体层级维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NCI 计量方式（公允价值法 / 比例法）</td>\n<td>决定取得日 NCI 与商誉金额</td>\n<td>取得日政策选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否全额抵销未实现利润</td>\n<td>决定分摊基数</td>\n<td>抵销政策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个变量都需要在系统里被显式记录，而不是在计算时临时判断。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;子公司净资产&lt;br/&gt;取得日公允价值&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;NCI 计量方式&lt;br/&gt;IFRS 3.19&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;公允价值法&quot;| C[&quot;NCI = 公允价值&lt;br/&gt;含全部商誉&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;比例法&quot;| D[&quot;NCI = 净资产 × 少数比例&lt;br/&gt;仅母公司商誉&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;商誉 = 对价 + NCI − 净资产&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    F[&quot;本期子公司净利&quot;] --&gt; G[&quot;抵销未实现内部利润&lt;br/&gt;见 2.2&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;NCI 分摊基数&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;NCI 当期损益&lt;br/&gt;= 基数 × 少数比例&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;合并权益变动:&lt;br/&gt;NCI 期初 + 本期 + OCI − 股利&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"子公司净资产&lt;br/&gt;取得日公允价值\"] --&gt; B{\"NCI 计量方式&lt;br/&gt;IFRS 3.19\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"公允价值法\"| C[\"NCI = 公允价值&lt;br/&gt;含全部商誉\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"比例法\"| D[\"NCI = 净资产 × 少数比例&lt;br/&gt;仅母公司商誉\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"商誉 = 对价 + NCI − 净资产\"]\n    D --&gt; E\n    F[\"本期子公司净利\"] --&gt; G[\"抵销未实现内部利润&lt;br/&gt;见 2.2\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"NCI 分摊基数\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"NCI 当期损益&lt;br/&gt;= 基数 × 少数比例\"]\n    I --&gt; J[\"合并权益变动:&lt;br/&gt;NCI 期初 + 本期 + OCI − 股利\"]</pre><h2 id=\"有效持股比例-比表面复杂\">有效持股比例：比表面复杂</h2><p>最直观的 NCI 计算是「直接持股比例」。但集团结构一旦有层级，直观比例就会出错。</p>\n<p>设母公司 P 持有 S1 80%，S1 持有 S2 60%。P 对 S2 的<strong>直接</strong>持股为零，但通过 S1 的<strong>有效</strong>持股是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\% \\times 60\\% = 48\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">48%</span></span></span></span></span>。因此在合并 S2 时，NCI 比例是 52%，而不是 40%。</p>\n<p>当存在多层交叉持股或少数股东同时持有中间层与底层股权时，计算变成求一个线性方程组。实用的工程解法是<strong>按层级自上而下递推</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NCI_k = 1 - \\sum_{j \\in parents(k)} ownership(j \\to k) \\times effective(j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>effective(j)</code> 是 j 主体层面母公司的有效权益比例，从顶层 = 1 开始递推。</p>\n<h3 id=\"间接持股的两种口径\">间接持股的两种口径</h3><p>需要区分两个不同的比例，它们回答不同的问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>有效比例（effective ownership）</strong>：母公司最终享有该主体净利与净资产的份额，用于利润与权益分摊；</li>\n<li><strong>直接比例（direct ownership）</strong>：某一层股东对下一层的直接持有比例，用于逐层抵销分录的编制。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在逐层抵销的实现里，每一层的抵销用直接比例；在计算最终合并数时，用有效比例验证。<strong>两者必须互为校验</strong>：把所有层级的抵销分录加总，结果应当等于按有效比例计算的分摊。若不等，说明某一层的比例维护错了。</p>\n<h3 id=\"递推的实现\">递推的实现</h3><p>有效比例是一个纯的图计算，输入是持股关系表，输出是每个主体上母公司的有效权益：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"effective_ratio(entity):&#10;  if entity in memo: return memo[entity]      # 交叉持股下必须记忆化，否则指数爆炸&#10;  total = 0&#10;  for (parent, pct) in direct_holdings(entity):   # 直接持有 entity 的股东&#10;      total += pct * effective_ratio(parent)&#10;  memo[entity] = total&#10;  return total&#10;# 顶层母公司（最终控制方）的 effective_ratio 定义为 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>effective_ratio(entity):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if entity in memo: return memo[entity]      # 交叉持股下必须记忆化，否则指数爆炸</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  total = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (parent, pct) in direct_holdings(entity):   # 直接持有 entity 的股东</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      total += pct * effective_ratio(parent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  memo[entity] = total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 顶层母公司（最终控制方）的 effective_ratio 定义为 1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两点注意：交叉持股会产生递归回路，必须用记忆化加环检测（命中正在计算的节点即报错，而不是无限递归）；<code>direct_holdings</code> 的持股比例必须取自<strong>生效于当前期间</strong>的关系记录，历史持股变动不能污染本期计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合并价差的形成\">合并价差的形成</h2><p>「合并价差」是早年用语，现在的准则把它拆成了两个有明确会计含义的科目：<strong>商誉</strong>与<strong>廉价购买利得</strong>。差额的形成源于对价与所取得权益的比较。</p>\n<p>IFRS 3 第 32 段规定商誉的算式结构：商誉 = (a) 对价 + NCI 计量金额 + 分步取得中原持股取得日公允价值 − (b) 可辨认净资产净额。把它展开成三个数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;acquireeId&quot;: &quot;S2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;acquisitionDate&quot;: &quot;2026-01-15&quot;,&#10;  &quot;considerationTransferred&quot;: 12000000.0,&#10;  &quot;nciMeasurement&quot;: { &quot;method&quot;: &quot;proportionate&quot;, &quot;amount&quot;: 2000000.0 },&#10;  &quot;previouslyHeldInterestFv&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;identifiableNetAssetsFv&quot;: 10000000.0,&#10;  &quot;goodwill&quot;: 4000000.0,&#10;  &quot;formula&quot;: &quot;(12000000 + 2000000 + 0) - 10000000 = 4000000&quot;,&#10;  &quot;measurementPeriodOpen&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;measurementPeriodDeadline&quot;: &quot;2027-01-15&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"acquireeId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"S2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"acquisitionDate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-01-15\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"considerationTransferred\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12000000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"nciMeasurement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"proportionate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"previouslyHeldInterestFv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"identifiableNetAssetsFv\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"goodwill\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4000000.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"formula\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"(12000000 + 2000000 + 0) - 10000000 = 4000000\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"measurementPeriodOpen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"measurementPeriodDeadline\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-01-15\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>measurementPeriodOpen</code>：IFRS 3 第 45–49 段允许在取得日后<strong>不超过一年</strong>的期间内，对暂估金额按新获得的信息追溯调整（&quot;the measurement period shall not exceed one year from the acquisition date&quot;）。系统必须把这一个标志与截止日存下来，否则会计期间关闭后无人记得还有一笔待调整。</p>\n<h3 id=\"计量期内的调整\">计量期内的调整</h3><p>计量期调整的处理方式是追溯的：调整「如同企业合并的会计处理在取得日即已完成」（as if the accounting for the business combination had been completed at the acquisition date），包括修正比较信息与相关的折旧、摊销或其他损益影响，因此系统必须能<strong>重开已关闭期间的合并底稿</strong>（见<a href=\"consolidation-worksheet-adjustment\">合并工作底稿与调整</a>的版本机制）。计量期结束或信息不再可获得后，后续调整改按 IAS 8 处理差错或估计变更，路径完全不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nci-的两种计量方式\">NCI 的两种计量方式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比项</th>\n<th>比例法</th>\n<th>公允价值法（全商誉）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NCI 取得日金额</td>\n<td>可辨认净资产 × 少数比例</td>\n<td>NCI 的公允价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商誉内容</td>\n<td>仅归属母公司部分</td>\n<td>母子公司的全部商誉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要的信息</td>\n<td>净资产公允价值</td>\n<td>另需 NCI 公允价值（估值成本）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并净资产</td>\n<td>相同</td>\n<td>相同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品誉金额</td>\n<td>较小</td>\n<td>较大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后续减值影响</td>\n<td>减值仅影响母公司</td>\n<td>减值在母子公司间分担</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键事实：<strong>两种方式下合并净资产总额完全相同</strong>，差异只在商誉与 NCI 之间如何分配。这解释了为什么选择计量方式不影响集团的净资产，却影响资产负债表的结构与后续的减值分摊。IFRS 3 第 19 段只允许对「赋予持有者在清算时按比例分得净资产份额的现时所有权权益」在两种方式中选择；其他组成部分的 NCI 按取得日公允价值计量，除非其他准则另有要求。选择必须作为<strong>会计政策</strong>在集团内一致适用（IFRS 10 第 19 段要求统一会计政策），因此系统上应把计量方式做成取得日冻结的政策字段，而不是每期可改的参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nci-的后续计量与权益变动\">NCI 的后续计量与权益变动</h2><p>取得日之后，NCI 的账面价值按如下方式滚动：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NCI_{end} = NCI_{begin} + share\\_of\\_profit + share\\_of\\_OCI - dividends\\_paid</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"分摊基数是抵销后的净利\">分摊基数是抵销后的净利</h3><p><code>share_of_profit</code> 的基数不是子公司的单体净利，而是<strong>经过抵销调整后的金额</strong>。两个方向的调整都要做：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>剔除以该子公司为卖方或买方的<a href=\"../intercompany-matching-elimination/intercompany-sales-profit-eliminate\">未实现内部利润</a>；</li>\n<li>加上/减去<a href=\"consolidation-worksheet-adjustment\">合并层准则调整分录</a>对子公司净利的影响。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>只有当一个子公司的全部内部交易对手都是母公司时，用单体净利才近似正确。在跨境集团里这几乎从不成立，所以分摊基数必须从底稿取，不能从单体报表取。</p>\n<h3 id=\"未丧失控制权下的权益变动\">未丧失控制权下的权益变动</h3><p>母公司增持或减持而不丧失控制权时，IFRS 10 第 23 段规定这类交易「属于权益交易」。会计含义是：不确认损益，只在母公司权益与 NCI 之间转移账面价值。系统实现上表现为一条特殊的权益调整分录：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 母公司增持子公司少数股权（未丧失控制权），IFRS 10.23&#10;INSERT INTO elim_journal_line (journal_id, group_account, dr_cr, amount, memo)&#10;VALUES&#10;  (:jid, &#39;4201_少数股东权益&#39;,   &#39;DR&#39;, :nci_derecognized, &#39;减少 NCI 账面价值&#39;),&#10;  (:jid, &#39;1001_银行存款&#39;,       &#39;CR&#39;, :cash_paid,        &#39;支付增持对价&#39;),&#10;  (:jid, &#39;4301_资本公积&#39;,       &#39;DR&#39;, :diff_positive,    &#39;差额调整母公司权益（借或贷）&#39;);&#10;-- 若 cash_paid &lt; nci_derecognized，则差额改为贷记资本公积&#10;-- 整个过程不经过任何损益科目\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 母公司增持子公司少数股权（未丧失控制权），IFRS 10.23</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elim_journal_line (journal_id, group_account, dr_cr, amount, memo)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (:jid, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'4201_少数股东权益'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, :nci_derecognized, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'减少 NCI 账面价值'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (:jid, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1001_银行存款'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, :cash_paid,        </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'支付增持对价'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (:jid, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'4301_资本公积'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, :diff_positive,    </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'差额调整母公司权益（借或贷）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 若 cash_paid &#x3C; nci_derecognized，则差额改为贷记资本公积</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 整个过程不经过任何损益科目</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里最常犯的错误是把这个差额计入「投资收益」。准则明确规定这是权益交易，不产生损益——把它计入损益会让合并利润表凭空多出一笔利得，且这笔利得在准则下不存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与合并报表各表的接口\">与合并报表各表的接口</h2><p>NCI 不是孤立的一个数，它同时出现在三张表上，且必须互相勾稽：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>报表</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>金额来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>合并资产负债表</td>\n<td>权益内部，独立列示于母公司权益之外</td>\n<td>期末 NCI 余额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并利润表</td>\n<td>净利下的「归属于少数股东的损益」</td>\n<td>本期分摊额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并权益变动表</td>\n<td>NCI 单独一行，按权益项目展开</td>\n<td>期初 + 本期变动明细</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并现金流量表</td>\n<td>不直接出现；但支付给 NCI 的股利属筹资活动</td>\n<td>见<a href=\"consolidated-cashflow-note-data\">合并现金流</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>勾稽关系的核心是一句话：<strong>权益变动表上 NCI 行的期初到期末变动，必须等于资产负债表上 NCI 期初与期末的差</strong>。这条断言应当与底稿的其他平衡性断言一起跑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"累积其他综合收益中的-nci-份额\">累积其他综合收益中的 NCI 份额</h3><p>当子公司有外币折算差额时（见<a href=\"../multi-entity-ledger-close/multicurrency-revalue-fx-gainloss\">多币种重估</a>），其他综合收益中属于 NCI 的部分也要分摊。一个常见的实现缺陷是只分摊了利润表的净利，忘了分摊其他综合收益，导致权益变动表上 NCI 行的加总与本期的综合收益总额对不上。</p>\n<p>处理方式与净利分摊同构：基数取子公司本期其他综合收益变动额（含折算差额），乘以少数比例。若折算差额本身是在合并层生成的（对子公司报表整体折算时产生），需要先按主体拆分该差额，再按比例分摊。</p>\n<h3 id=\"nci-滚动的校验断言\">NCI 滚动的校验断言</h3><p>权益变动表是 NCI 最容易出错的地方，因为它需要同时对上三个方向。把关账断言写成 SQL，可以把它从人工核对变成自动拦截：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- NCI 滚动断言：期初 + 本期分摊 − 股利 = 期末，且与资产负债表一致&#10;WITH roll AS (&#10;  SELECT n.subject,&#10;         SUM(n.amount_group_ccy) FILTER (WHERE n.item = &#39;opening&#39;)          AS opening,&#10;         SUM(n.amount_group_ccy) FILTER (WHERE n.item = &#39;share_of_profit&#39;)  AS sop,&#10;         SUM(n.amount_group_ccy) FILTER (WHERE n.item = &#39;share_of_oci&#39;)     AS soci,&#10;         SUM(n.amount_group_ccy) FILTER (WHERE n.item = &#39;dividends&#39;)        AS div,&#10;         SUM(n.amount_group_ccy) FILTER (WHERE n.item = &#39;closing&#39;)          AS closing&#10;  FROM nci_rollforward n&#10;  WHERE n.period = :period&#10;  GROUP BY n.subject&#10;)&#10;SELECT r.subject,&#10;       r.opening + r.sop + r.soci - r.div AS computed_closing,&#10;       r.closing                          AS reported_closing,&#10;       bs.nci_balance                     AS balance_sheet_nci&#10;FROM roll r&#10;JOIN bs_nci bs ON bs.subject = r.subject AND bs.period = :period&#10;WHERE ABS(r.opening + r.sop + r.soci - r.div - r.closing) &gt; :tolerance&#10;   OR ABS(r.closing - bs.nci_balance) &gt; :tolerance;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NCI 滚动断言：期初 + 本期分摊 − 股利 = 期末，且与资产负债表一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> roll </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_group_ccy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'opening'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opening,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_group_ccy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'share_of_profit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sop,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_group_ccy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'share_of_oci'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> soci,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_group_ccy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'dividends'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> div,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount_group_ccy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'closing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> closing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nci_rollforward n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">period</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subject</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">opening</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sop</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">soci</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> computed_closing,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                          AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reported_closing,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       bs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nci_balance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                     AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> balance_sheet_nci</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> roll r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bs_nci bs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">period</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">opening</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sop</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">soci</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">div</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :tolerance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">closing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nci_balance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :tolerance;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>返回空集才通过。注意第二个条件：它检查权益变动表的 NCI 期末余额与资产负债表上的 NCI 是否一致——这条勾稽若缺失，两张表可以各自内部自洽却互不吻合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>NCI 是子公司净资产与净利中不属于母公司的部分，必须列示在合并权益内部并与母公司权益分开（IFRS 10.22）。</li>\n<li>持股比例要用<strong>有效比例</strong>自上而下递推，直接比例用于逐层抵销；两者必须互为校验。</li>\n<li>合并价差按 IFRS 3.32 拆为商誉与廉价购买利得；商誉算式包含对价、NCI 计量金额与分步取得的原持股公允价值。</li>\n<li>NCI 计量方式（IFRS 3.19 公允价值法与比例法）不改变合并净资产，只改变商誉与 NCI 的分配；选择是取得日冻结的政策。</li>\n<li>计量期（最长一年，IFRS 3.45–49）内的调整是追溯的，要求底稿支持重开已关闭期间。</li>\n<li>NCI 分摊基数是<strong>抵销后的净利</strong>，须从底稿取；同时要分摊其他综合收益（含折算差额），否则权益变动表勾稽失败。</li>\n<li>未丧失控制权的持股变动是权益交易（IFRS 10.23），不经损益；把它计入投资收益是高频错误。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"少数股东权益（NCI）与合并价差","id":"少数股东权益-nci-与合并价差"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"有效持股比例：比表面复杂","id":"有效持股比例-比表面复杂"},{"level":3,"text":"间接持股的两种口径","id":"间接持股的两种口径"},{"level":3,"text":"递推的实现","id":"递推的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"合并价差的形成","id":"合并价差的形成"},{"level":3,"text":"计量期内的调整","id":"计量期内的调整"},{"level":2,"text":"NCI 的两种计量方式","id":"nci-的两种计量方式"},{"level":2,"text":"NCI 的后续计量与权益变动","id":"nci-的后续计量与权益变动"},{"level":3,"text":"分摊基数是抵销后的净利","id":"分摊基数是抵销后的净利"},{"level":3,"text":"未丧失控制权下的权益变动","id":"未丧失控制权下的权益变动"},{"level":2,"text":"与合并报表各表的接口","id":"与合并报表各表的接口"},{"level":3,"text":"累积其他综合收益中的 NCI 份额","id":"累积其他综合收益中的-nci-份额"},{"level":3,"text":"NCI 滚动的校验断言","id":"nci-滚动的校验断言"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合并工作底稿与调整重分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-entity-financial-close-consolidation/consolidation-worksheet/consolidation-worksheet-adjustment"},"next":{"title":"合并现金流量表与附注数据采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multi-entity-financial-close-consolidation/consolidation-worksheet/consolidated-cashflow-note-data"}}